/-!
# Segmented inverse (S2), machine side 9: one complex line of `B₀`

The whole `B₀` line map (`B0seg = D̃' segJ C̃`) on a line `y` of `t` Gaussian items, as list
passes:

1. selection and scaling (`selC`): row `l < s` is the item `⌊(2tl + s)/(2s)⌋` times
